      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NOT CLIFFORD (1) has been out of the placings the last couple but was a Grade 5 winner (22.70) three back at Maitland. Expecting sharp improvement. HEY MICKEY (4) goes very well this course and distance starting nine times for three wins and five minors. In the money last time at this track (22.72) in a Mix 2/3, finishing a 5 length third. Can hit the frame with the right run. SHANTI BAY (2) shapes well for this on her superb win a few runs back, getting around Goulburn over 350m in 19.76 then hitting the frame in both runs since. Smart winner three back and looks a key chance on that form.",
